  "cusolverDnXsytrf_bufferSize": {
    "doc": "Symmetric / Hermitian indefinite factorization (SYTRF / HETRF), 64-bit interface. SYTRF and HETRF dispatch to a shared implementation specialized at compile time (is_hermitian template parameter): SYTRF computes A = U*D*U^T (or L*D*L^T), HETRF computes A = U*D*U^H (or L*D*L^H) with a real D-diagonal and Hermitian-aware arithmetic in the panel updates. The bufferSize and compute routines share the same argument list (workspace queries accept the pivot pointer purely for signature symmetry; the buffer size does not depend on ipiv).",
